  "question": {
    "text": "<p>A point object is moving with a speed <math> <mtext>v</mtext> </math> in front of an arrangement of two mirrors as shown in figure. If the velocity of image in mirror <math> <mrow> <msub> <mtext>M</mtext> <mn>1</mn> </msub> </mrow> </math> with respect to image in mirror <math> <mrow> <msub> <mtext>M</mtext> <mn>2</mn> </msub> </mrow> </math> is&nbsp;<math><mrow><mtext>n(v&nbsp;sin</mtext><mtext> </mtext><mi>θ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">),</mo></mrow>&nbsp;&nbsp;</math> find <math> <mtext>n</mtext> </math><br />\r<br />\r<br />\r&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/EM0013253_Ques1_1.jpg\" /></p>\r",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "2",
  "solution": {
    "text": "Angle between <math> <mrow> <msub> <mrow> <mi></mi><mi>v</mi><mo>⁡</mo> </mrow> <msub> <mtext>I</mtext> <mn>1</mn> </msub> </msub> <mo>&amp;</mo> <msub> <mrow> <mi></mi><mi>v</mi><mo>⁡</mo> </mrow> <msub> <mtext>I</mtext> <mn>2</mn> </msub> </msub> <mtext>&nbsp;is</mtext> <mn>&nbsp;2</mn> <mi>θ</mi> </mrow> </math>. Their magnitudes is <em>v</em>.<br /><br /><br /><u><strong><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/EM0013253_AnsExp1_1.jpg\" style=\"width: 660px; height: 243px;\" /></strong></u><br /><br /><br /><math> <mrow> <mo>∴</mo><msub> <mi>v</mi> <mrow> <msub> <mi>I</mi> <mn>1</mn> </msub> </mrow> </msub> <msub> <mi>v</mi> <mrow> <msub> <mi>I</mi> <mn>2</mn> </msub> </mrow> </msub> <mo>=</mo><mrow><mo>|</mo> <mrow> <msub> <mover accent=\"true\"> <mi>v</mi> <mo>→</mo> </mover> <mrow> <msub> <mi>I</mi> <mn>1</mn> </msub> </mrow> </msub> <mo>−</mo><msub> <mover accent=\"true\"> <mi>v</mi> <mo>→</mo> </mover> <mrow> <msub> <mi>I</mi> <mn>2</mn> </msub> </mrow> </msub> </mrow> <mo>|</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><msqrt> <mrow> <msup> <mi>v</mi> <mn>2</mn> </msup> <mo>+</mo><msup> <mi>v</mi> <mn>2</mn> </msup> <mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>v</mi><mtext> </mtext><mtext> </mtext><mi>v</mi><mi>cos</mi><mn>2</mn><mi>θ</mi></mrow> </msqrt> </mrow> </math><br /><br /><math> <mrow> <mo>=</mo> <mn>2</mn> <mi></mi><mi>v</mi><mo>⁡</mo> <mtext>&nbsp;sin</mtext> <mi>θ</mi> </mrow> </math>",
